 "remarks": "Welcome to this renovated 3 Bedrooms, 1 1/2 Bathroom duplex located in the coveted Spring Hill area of Norwalk. The main level open concept kitchen and living area are perfect for today's lifestyle. Upstairs you will find 3 generous bedrooms and a full bathroom. The lower level presents additional space complemented with laundry. The rear deck off the kitchen provides an ideal spot for outdoor gatherings and grilling. 2 Assigned private parking spaces are included with the unit. Additional off-street parking as well for guest. Commuters dream with quick access to 95, Route 7 and SONO Train Station. Less than 1 mile from the SONO Collection mall.",
